*.pyc

# Private operator brief — for Athar only, never committed or shared
OPERATOR-BRIEF.md

# Real LinkedIn / contact exports (names, profile URLs of real people). The
# repo is public — these are one `git add -A` from being published. The
# synthetic fixture (fixtures/linkedin-sample-export.csv) stays tracked.
*LinkedIn_Contacts*.csv
*LinkedIn_Contacts*.xlsx
*Connections*.csv
!fixtures/**

